      "text": "吸收迷宫英雄灵魂中的能力，并以剑、法杖和枪刃切换战斗风格",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "[ ■ Rogue-like action] Choose your favorite ability from the souls of the heroes lying in the labyrinthine castle and acquire it. Enjoy a variety of combat styles with one-handed swords, magic staves, gunblades, and more!",
