    {
      "text": "安全模式保留全部物品，挑战模式失败掉落背包但提高稀有装备与高属性魔物概率",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Choose Your Play Style: Safe Mode A casual exploration mode perfect for relaxed adventuring. Even if your exploration ends in failure, you’ll keep all the items you found. Challenge Mode A high-stakes mode for those seeking thrill and reward. If you're defeated and fail to return, you'll lose all the items you were carrying. However, the risks come with greater rewards—rare equipment drops more frequently, and it's easier to capture high-stat monsters. Note: Even if you lose equipment, you may be able to buy it back from the merchant at home.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2162820/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
